      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The studies have shown that the diet of the native residents of Taimyr is imbalanced of the major nutrients (high uptake of carbohydrates and low uptake of fats and proteins). A certain correlation has been found between the higher incidence rates of coronary heart disease, blood atherogenic lipoprotein levels and changed diet pattern."},
